- (1) Initial and further augmentation of capital and liabilities met out of the Shareholder's funds beyond solvency margin requirement; 

- (2) Compliance with Know your Customer (KYC) and Anti-Money Laundering (AML) guidelines issued by the Authority; 

- (3) Compliance with Foreign Exchange Management Act, 1999 and any other law in force governing the operations of such offices;
